From e7b9d412966df755d27d5b275537bc364a684ca0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:11:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: qcom: add native CAMSS IFE pipeline handler

Add the native Qualcomm CAMSS pipeline handler driving the hardware IFE PIX path, per-frame Media Request control binding, hardware 3A statistics processing, SmartFlash precapture estimation, OIS control, and sensor SOF timestamp and FrameDuration metadata propagation.
